---
---

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 560">
      <defs>
        <radialGradient id="hero-led-glow">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#5aa2ff" stop-opacity="0.95" />
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#5aa2ff" stop-opacity="0" />
        </radialGradient>
        <linearGradient id="hero-gate-fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#3b5588" />
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#1a2a4c" />
        </linearGradient>
        <filter id="hero-pulse-glow" x="-50%" y="-50%" width="200%" height="200%">
          <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="5" result="blur" />
          <feMerge>
            <feMergeNode in="blur" />
            <feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic" />
          </feMerge>
        </filter>
      </defs>
      <g class="hero-pcb">
        <path d="M20 110 H120 V50 H260" pathLength="1000" />
        <path d="M624 30 V120 H520" pathLength="1000" />
        <path d="M40 480 H130 V410" pathLength="1000" />
        <path d="M630 530 H500 V490" pathLength="1000" />
        <circle cx="260" cy="50" r="6" />
        <circle cx="520" cy="120" r="6" />
        <circle cx="130" cy="410" r="6" />
        <circle cx="500" cy="490" r="6" />
      </g>
      <path class="hero-hex" d="M380 80 L553 180 V380 L380 480 L207 380 V180 Z" pathLength="1000" />
      <path class="hero-trace" d="M180 -10 V240 H300" pathLength="1000" />
      <path class="hero-trace" d="M240 570 V320 H300" pathLength="1000" />
      <path class="hero-trace" d="M472 280 H590 V440 H650" pathLength="1000" />
      <g filter="url(#hero-pulse-glow)">
        <path class="hero-pulse pulse-a" d="M180 -10 V240 H300" pathLength="1000" />
        <path class="hero-pulse pulse-b" d="M240 570 V320 H300" pathLength="1000" />
        <path class="hero-pulse pulse-out" d="M472 280 H590 V440 H650" pathLength="1000" />
      </g>
      <path class="hero-gate" d="M300 200 H360 A80 80 0 0 1 360 360 H300 Z" />
      <circle class="hero-led-glow" cx="456" cy="280" r="60" fill="url(#hero-led-glow)" />
      <circle class="hero-led" cx="456" cy="280" r="14" />
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1 class="hero-title">
      <span class="hero-org">南山大学 学生エンジニア団体 NAND</span>
      <span class="line"><span>作りながら、</span></span>
      <span class="line"><span>学び合う。</span></span>
    </h1>
    <span class="hero-signal" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="hero-copy">
      プログラミング経験の有無にかかわらず、Web・アプリ・ハードウェアなど「作りたい」を持ち寄って、仲間と一緒に形にしていく場所です。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="#join">参加について見る</a>
      <a class="button ghost" href="https://x.com/nandsongen" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <svg class="x-logo" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.9 2H22l-6.8 7.8L23.2 22h-6.3l-4.9-6.4L6.4 22H3.3l7.3-8.3L2.8 2h6.4l4.4 5.9L18.9 2Zm-1.1 18.1h1.7L7.9 3.8H6.1l11.7 16.3Z" /></svg>
        Xで連絡する
      </a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-points" aria-label="参加の目安">
      <li>初心者歓迎</li>
      <li>学年・学部不問</li>
      <li>見学歓迎</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
